{
    "title": "Car Driving 3D: Race Master",
    "description": "Car Driving 3D: Race Master brings you a whole fresh pocket racing experience. \r\n\r\nCar Driving 3D: Race Master is created with the latest-updated engine, stunning colorful 3D graphics which provides you fast-furious racing experience and instant access anywhere anytime you want to play.  The game is crash-free for your best gaming experience. \r\n\r\nCar Driving 3D: Race Master contains: \r\n- Multi language versions: \r\nWe have many different suitable languages for your living area for the playing journey. \r\n\r\n- Multiple car selection:\r\nBored of using the same car all the time? This game is here for you as we supply you with plenty of sport and modern cars.  Our exclusive features allow you to customize car body paint, the rims, and wheels or apply different-looking detailed body parts such as radiator supports, step bumper.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Diffrerent game modes:\r\nTake your car driving skills to a new level and beat other players from all over the world with the competitive mode. There is also time-limited mode for a neat and breath-taking experience. Championship mode is also available in our game.\r\n\r\n- Unlimited levels:\r\nA huge range of variable surfaces and obstacles to race over and around at breakneck speed is included respectively in each levels. Special levels with easter eggs will make your mind blown for a very long time\r\n\r\n- Quality graphics:\r\nWe have tried our best to bring to you the most stunning and colourful 3D graphics for a new driving experience. We also provide you unique HD 3D graphics features detailed car crashes, fully functional damage, and dynamic reflections for truly HD racing.\r\n\r\n- Impressive sound:\r\nWe also try to bring you a fantastic experience in music along with qualified graphics.Our game focus on enhancing sound effect quality like the engine sound, background music. Enjoy the music while playing our games. Music is also customizable in settings. \r\nReady for speed? Fasten your seat belt, keep your feet on the gas, dodge every obstacles, and try to keep out the way of your equally manic rivals with your best manner in super-fast, super-exciting, psychedelic races.\r\n\r\nOur game is free but ads are supported. If you have any complains, please read our policy or reach out to us for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Car Driving 3D: Race Master brings you a whole fresh pocket racing experience. <br><br>Car Driving 3D: Race Master is created with the latest-updated engine, stunning colorful 3D graphics which provides you fast-furious racing experience and instant access anywhere anytime you want to play.  The game is crash-free for your best gaming experience. <br><br>Car Driving 3D: Race Master contains: <br>- Multi language versions: <br>We have many different suitable languages for your living area for the playing journey. <br><br>- Multiple car selection:<br>Bored of using the same car all the time? This game is here for you as we supply you with plenty of sport and modern cars.  Our exclusive features allow you to customize car body paint, the rims, and wheels or apply different-looking detailed body parts such as radiator supports, step bumper.<br><br><br>- Diffrerent game modes:<br>Take your car driving skills to a new level and beat other players from all over the world with the competitive mode. There is also time-limited mode for a neat and breath-taking experience. Championship mode is also available in our game.<br><br>- Unlimited levels:<br>A huge range of variable surfaces and obstacles to race over and around at breakneck speed is included respectively in each levels. Special levels with easter eggs will make your mind blown for a very long time<br><br>- Quality graphics:<br>We have tried our best to bring to you the most stunning and colourful 3D graphics for a new driving experience. We also provide you unique HD 3D graphics features detailed car crashes, fully functional damage, and dynamic reflections for truly HD racing.<br><br>- Impressive sound:<br>We also try to bring you a fantastic experience in music along with qualified graphics.Our game focus on enhancing sound effect quality like the engine sound, background music. Enjoy the music while playing our games. Music is also customizable in settings. <br>Ready for speed? Fasten your 